{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body><img src=\"https://fs.mingpao.com/ins/20260508/s00024/25b4043f73a549fcab3259bf5c7af244.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:1em\">\n    <p>5月7日，黑龍江哈爾濱古梨園內一棵140歲高齡的古梨樹悄然綻放，花開如雪，吸引遊客紛至，賞花拍照。（中新社）</p>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T02:43:29.761080+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":54,"images":1,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none"}}